{"lines": ["Four people told police a seven-foot winged creature chased their car at 100 miles an hour.", "November 15, 1966. Point Pleasant, West Virginia, beside an old munitions plant.", "Its eyes glowed red. When they sped away, it took flight and kept pace.", "Days later, more witnesses came forward. Newspapers named it Mothman, probably after a Batman villain.", "Thirteen months on, the Silver Bridge collapsed in rush hour. Forty-six people died.", "A famous book tied the two together. But investigators found the cause: one flaw, a tenth of an inch deep, in one steel link.", "And that's not the strangest part. A biologist said the sightings fit a sandhill crane. Another expert blamed barred owls.", "Warning, or just a bird? Comment WARNING or BIRD."], "words": [["Four", 0.0, 0.2], ["people", 0.2, 0.54], ["told", 0.54, 0.9], ["police", 0.9, 1.14], ["a", 1.88, 1.96], ["seven-foot", 1.96, 2.58], ["winged", 2.58, 2.98], ["creature", 2.98, 3.34], ["chased", 3.72, 4.0], ["their", 4.0, 4.34], ["car", 4.34, 4.62], ["at", 4.62, 5.16], ["100", 5.16, 5.42], ["miles", 5.42, 6.12], ["an", 6.12, 6.44], ["hour.", 6.44, 6.7], ["November", 7.202, 7.44], ["15,", 7.44, 7.9], ["1966.", 8.54, 8.88], ["Point", 10.56, 10.8], ["Pleasant,", 10.8, 11.24], ["West", 11.54, 11.74], ["Virginia,", 11.74, 12.3], ["beside", 12.76, 13.08], ["an", 13.08, 13.32], ["old", 13.32, 13.46], ["munitions", 13.46, 13.82], ["plant.", 13.82, 14.36], ["Its", 14.938, 15.06], ["eyes", 15.06, 15.32], ["glowed", 15.32, 15.82], ["red.", 15.82, 16.06], ["When", 16.64, 16.8], ["they", 16.8, 16.92], ["sped", 16.92, 17.1], ["away,", 17.1, 17.4], ["it", 17.82, 17.98], ["took", 17.98, 18.14], ["flight", 18.14, 18.42], ["and", 18.42, 18.86], ["kept", 18.86, 19.04], ["pace.", 19.04, 19.44], ["Days", 20.021, 20.08], ["later,", 20.08, 20.44], ["more", 20.7, 20.9], ["witnesses", 20.9, 21.26], ["came", 21.26, 21.7], ["forward.", 21.7, 22.18], ["Newspapers", 22.84, 23.42], ["named", 23.42, 23.74], ["it", 23.74, 23.96], ["Mo